# PROVENANCE: measured from genuine DESFire EV3 2K UID 044D234A281F90 over PC/SC.
# The positive trial uses the EV1 AES session-key MAC and preserves the session.
# The negative trial sends the configured proximity-key MAC, receives an opaque
# eight-byte response, and observes the card's 0x0B rejection latch.
